{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "# 🛡️ Windows DNS — Threat Hunting, Health & Cost (V2)\r\n\r\nEnd-to-end DNS visibility for **Microsoft Sentinel**, from executive KPIs to analyst pivots. Built on `ASimDnsActivityLogs` (ASIM DNS via AMA), `DnsAuditEvents`, `ThreatIntelIndicators`, `SecurityAlert` and `SecurityIncident`. Every tile honours the **filters** (time range, excluded IPs, NetworkAllowlist toggle, thresholds, IOC/device search) at the top.\r\n\r\n## What this workbook covers (by tab)\r\n| Tab | Capabilities |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| 📊 **Overview** | **Executive summary** + consolidated security findings · total queries · unique clients · unique domains · DNS servers · NXDOMAIN · TXT/NULL — volume trend, response-code mix, top servers, **day×hour heatmap**, top TLDs, per-/24 subnet |\r\n| 📡 **Telemetry Health** | Ingestion KPIs (events/hour, sources, GB) · **silent/stale source detection** · ingestion trend · ASIM parsing/normalization health |\r\n| 📈 **Noisy Traffic** | Top talkers · top domains · query-type mix · PTR/reverse noise · **cost estimate** (GB/day, PTR share, projected savings) |\r\n| 🧭 **Behavioral** | Record-type monitoring (TXT/NULL/ANY) · query-length analytics (avg/median/P95/P99 + histogram) · internal vs external · newly-active clients · **client baseline spike** · **query-volume anomaly** (spikes & drops) |\r\n| 🚨 **Suspicious & Malicious** | Malicious summary (by client IP / DNS server) · NXDOMAIN · long-query & subdomain tunneling · TXT abuse · DGA (digit-ratio) · **Shannon entropy** · suspicious/risk-classified TLDs · zone transfers · newly-observed & rare domains · **beaconing** · **dynamic DNS** · **fast flux** · domain drill-down |\r\n| 🌍 **Geolocation** | Country choropleth (green→red by % malicious) · malicious city bubble map · top source-geo table |\r\n| 🎯 **Threat Intelligence** | IOC **domain** hits · IOC **IP** hits · infected devices · TI indicator lookup |\r\n| 🔔 **Alerts & Incidents** | DNS-related `SecurityAlert` + open `SecurityIncident`, searchable by IP/domain; alerts by severity |\r\n| 🔎 **Investigation** | One-click **device pivot**: DNS profile, recent queries, TI hits for a client IP |\r\n| ️ **ATT&CK Coverage** | DNS analytics mapped to MITRE ATT&CK + detections currently firing |\r\n\r\n## Filters (top of page)\r\n| Filter | What it does |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| **Workspace** | Target Log Analytics / Sentinel workspace (portable) |\r\n| **Time range** | Applies to every tile except the baseline/anomaly comparison tiles (newly-observed domains, newly-active clients, client baseline spike, volume anomaly) which need a fixed historical window |\r\n| **NetworkAllowlist** | On = drop IPs allow-listed by `ExcludeAllowlistedIPs_AzureCustom(SrcIpAddr)`; Off = no lookup |\r\n| **Excluded IPs** | Comma-separated client IPs / CIDR / ranges removed from every DNS tile (`SrcIpAddr`) |\r\n| **Domain contains** | Substring filter for the Malicious-tab domain drill-down |\r\n| **NXDOMAIN / Subdomain / Query-length / TXT / DGA / Entropy thresholds** | Tune each malicious-detection tile without editing KQL |\r\n| **Price per GB** | Your ingestion price for the cost-estimate tiles |\r\n| **Alert / IOC search** | Pivot the Alerts & Incidents tab and TI lookup to a specific IP or domain |\r\n| **Investigate client IP** | Client IP for the Investigation-tab device pivot |\r\n| **Internal domain suffixes** | Classify Internal vs External DNS (Behavioral tab) |\r\n\r\n## Notes & dependencies\r\n- **Alerts tab** needs `SecurityAlert`/`SecurityIncident`; **TI tabs** need a Threat Intelligence connector (`ThreatIntelIndicators`).\r\n- **IOC-IP hits / Fast flux** depend on the resolved IP (`DstIpAddr`) being logged — query-side Windows DNS logs may leave it sparse (the domain-IOC path is always reliable).\r\n- **Not implemented** (require external enrichment not in these tables): domain **age / registrar reputation** and newly-registered-domain feeds — add a WHOIS/RDAP or domain-reputation watchlist to enable."
      },
      "name": "title"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "p-ws",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Workspace",
            "label": "Workspace",
            "type": 5,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": false,
            "quote": "",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "typeSettings": {
              "resourceTypeFilter": {
                "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces": true
              },
              "additionalResourceOptions": [],
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 86400000
            },
            "defaultValue": "value::1"
          },
          {
            "id": "p-timerange",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "label": "Time range",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                {
                  "durationMs": 3600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 14400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 43200000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 86400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 172800000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 604800000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 1209600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 2592000000
                }
              ],
              "allowCustom": true
            },
            "value": {
              "durationMs": 604800000
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "p-watchlist",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "WatchlistFilter",
            "label": "NetworkAllowlist",
            "description": "Off = no watchlist lookup. On = excludes IPs allowlisted by the ExcludeAllowlistedIPs_AzureCustom() function from the detection pack (requires the NetworkAllowlist watchlist + function deployed).",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": false,
            "quote": "",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": []
            },
            "jsonData": "[{\"value\":\"| where true\",\"label\":\"Off (fast)\",\"selected\":true},{\"value\":\"| where isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ExcludeAllowlistedIPs_AzureCustom(SrcIpAddr))\",\"label\":\"On (NetworkAllowlist)\"}]",
            "value": "| where true"
          },
          {
            "id": "p-excip",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "ExcludedIPs",
            "label": "Excluded IPs / CIDR / Ranges",
            "description": "Comma-separated trusted client IPs / CIDR / IPv4 ranges applied to SrcIpAddr. Empty = no IP filter.",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": ""
          },
          {
            "id": "p-domainsearch",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DomainSearch",
            "label": "Domain contains",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": ""
          },
          {
            "id": "p-nx",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "NXDOMAINThreshold",
            "label": "NXDOMAIN distinct-domain threshold",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": "50"
          },
          {
            "id": "p-sub",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "SubdomainThreshold",
            "label": "Tunneling unique-subdomain threshold",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": "100"
          },
          {
            "id": "p-qlen",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "QueryLenThreshold",
            "label": "Long-query length threshold",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": "50"
          },
          {
            "id": "p-txt",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TunnelRecordThreshold",
            "label": "TXT/NULL/CNAME request threshold",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": "50"
          },
          {
            "id": "p-dga",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DigitRatioThreshold",
            "label": "DGA digit-ratio threshold",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": "0.3"
          },
          {
            "id": "p-price",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "PricePerGB",
            "label": "Price per GB (USD)",
            "description": "Log Analytics ingestion price per GB for your tier/region. Used only for the cost-estimate tiles.",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": "2.30"
          },
          {
            "id": "p-search",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "IPorDomainSearch",
            "label": "Alert / IOC search (IP or domain)",
            "description": "Filters the Alerts & Incidents tab and the TI indicator lookup. Empty = show DNS-related alerts + all indicators.",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": ""
          },
          {
            "id": "p-ent",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "EntropyThreshold",
            "label": "Domain entropy threshold",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": "3.5"
          },
          {
            "id": "p-int",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "InternalDomains",
            "label": "Internal domain suffixes",
            "description": "Comma-separated internal domain suffixes (e.g. corp.contoso.com,ad.contoso.com). Used by the Internal vs External tile.",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": ""
          },
          {
            "id": "p-dev",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DeviceSearch",
            "label": "Investigate client IP",
            "description": "Client source IP to pivot on in the Investigation tab.",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": ""
          },
          {
            "id": "p-tab",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "selectedTab",
            "label": "selectedTab",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": "overview",
            "isHiddenWhenLocked": true
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "parameters"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "**Filters:** `Excluded IPs` removes trusted client source IPs (SrcIpAddr) from every tile. `NetworkAllowlist = On` additionally drops IPs allow-listed by the shared `ExcludeAllowlistedIPs_AzureCustom()` function (same one the analytic rules use). Threshold pills tune the malicious-activity tiles. `Domain contains` powers the drill-down on the Malicious tab.",
        "style": "info"
      },
      "name": "FiltersHelp"
    },
    {
      "type": 11,
      "content": {
        "version": "LinkItem/1.0",
        "style": "tabs",
        "links": [
          {
            "id": "t-ov",
            "cellValue": "selectedTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "📊 Overview",
            "subTarget": "overview",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "t-tel",
            "cellValue": "selectedTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "📡 Telemetry Health",
            "subTarget": "telemetry",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "t-no",
            "cellValue": "selectedTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "📈 Noisy Traffic",
            "subTarget": "noise",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "t-beh",
            "cellValue": "selectedTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "🧭 Behavioral",
            "subTarget": "behavioral",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "t-ma",
            "cellValue": "selectedTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "🚨 Suspicious and Malicious",
            "subTarget": "malicious",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "t-geo",
            "cellValue": "selectedTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "🌍 Geolocation",
            "subTarget": "geo",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "t-ti",
            "cellValue": "selectedTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "🎯 Threat Intelligence",
            "subTarget": "ti",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "t-al",
            "cellValue": "selectedTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "🔔 Alerts and Incidents",
            "subTarget": "alerts",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "t-inv",
            "cellValue": "selectedTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "🔎 Investigation",
            "subTarget": "investigation",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "t-att",
            "cellValue": "selectedTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "🗺️ ATT&CK Coverage",
            "subTarget": "attack",
            "style": "link"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "tabs"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "selectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "overview"
      },
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "# 🧭 Executive Summary\n\n**Start here.** One-look DNS security posture: headline metrics below, then the **consolidated findings panel** — every detection category with the count of affected clients/domains and a severity. Red rows need attention; open the matching tab for detail. Highlights covered: malicious traffic, threat-intel exposure, tunneling/DGA, beaconing/fast-flux, and ingestion cost.",
              "style": "info"
            },
            "name": "ex-h"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet SuspiciousTlds = dynamic(['zip','mov','xyz','top','gq','tk','ml','cf','ga','work','click','country','kim','science','party','review','loan','download','stream','racing','fit','cam','rest','mom']);\r\nlet TIdom = ThreatIntelIndicators | where IsActive == true and Revoked == false | where ObservableKey in~ ('domain-name:value','hostname:value') | summarize by v = tolower(ObservableValue);\r\nlet DnsMal = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    | extend _len = strlen(DnsQuery)\r\n    | extend _labels = split(DnsQuery, '.')\r\n    | extend _tld = tolower(tostring(_labels[array_length(_labels) - 1]))\r\n    | extend IsMalicious = (DnsResponseCode == 3) or (_len >= 50) or (DnsQueryTypeName in ('TXT','NULL')) or (_tld in (SuspiciousTlds));\r\nunion\r\n(DnsMal | where _len >= 50 | summarize Count = dcount(SrcIpAddr) | extend Finding = 'DNS tunneling (long queries)', Severity = '🟠 High', Order = 1),\r\n(DnsMal | where DnsQueryTypeName in ('TXT','NULL') | summarize Count = dcount(SrcIpAddr) | extend Finding = 'Suspicious TXT / NULL records', Severity = '🟠 High', Order = 2),\r\n(DnsMal | where DnsResponseCode == 3 | summarize Count = dcount(SrcIpAddr) | extend Finding = 'Excessive NXDOMAIN clients', Severity = '🟠 High', Order = 3),\r\n(DnsMal | where _tld in (SuspiciousTlds) | summarize Count = dcount(DnsQuery) | extend Finding = 'Suspicious TLD domains', Severity = '🟡 Medium', Order = 4),\r\n(DnsMal | where IsMalicious | summarize Count = dcount(SrcIpAddr) | extend Finding = 'Clients with malicious DNS', Severity = '🔴 Critical', Order = 5),\r\n(ASimDnsActivityLogs | where tolower(DnsQuery) in (TIdom) | summarize Count = dcount(SrcIpAddr) | extend Finding = 'Threat-intel domain hits', Severity = '🔴 Critical', Order = 6)\r\n| project Order, Severity, Finding, Count\r\n| sort by Order asc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "📋 Consolidated security findings (all categories)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Severity",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Count",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ex-findings"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## 📊 Overview — DNS activity at a glance"
            },
            "name": "ov-h"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nunion\r\n(ASimDnsActivityLogs | summarize Value = sum(EventCount) | extend Metric = 'Total Queries', Order = 1),\r\n(ASimDnsActivityLogs | summarize Value = dcount(SrcIpAddr) | extend Metric = 'Unique Clients', Order = 2),\r\n(ASimDnsActivityLogs | summarize Value = dcount(DnsQuery) | extend Metric = 'Unique Domains', Order = 3),\r\n(ASimDnsActivityLogs | summarize Value = dcount(DvcHostname) | extend Metric = 'DNS Servers', Order = 4),\r\n(ASimDnsActivityLogs | summarize Value = sumif(EventCount, DnsResponseCode == 3) | extend Metric = 'NXDOMAIN', Order = 5),\r\n(ASimDnsActivityLogs | summarize Value = sumif(EventCount, DnsQueryTypeName in ('TXT','NULL','CNAME')) | extend Metric = 'TXT/NULL/CNAME', Order = 6)\r\n| project Order, Metric, Value\r\n| sort by Order asc",
              "size": 3,
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "title": "Key metrics",
              "tileSettings": {
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Metric",
                  "formatter": 1
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Value",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "blue"
                  }
                },
                "showBorder": true
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ov-kpi"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| extend RCodeName = case(DnsResponseCode == 0, 'NOERROR', DnsResponseCode == 3, 'NXDOMAIN', DnsResponseCode == 2, 'SERVFAIL', DnsResponseCode == 5, 'REFUSED', DnsResponseCode == 1, 'FORMERR', strcat('RCODE-', tostring(DnsResponseCode)))\r\n| summarize Queries = sum(EventCount) by bin(TimeGenerated, 30m), RCodeName",
              "size": 0,
              "visualization": "timechart",
              "title": "Query volume over time (by response code)",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ov-vol"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| summarize Queries = sum(EventCount) by DvcHostname\r\n| top 15 by Queries desc",
              "size": 1,
              "visualization": "barchart",
              "title": "Top DNS servers by volume",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ov-srv"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| extend RCodeName = case(DnsResponseCode == 0, 'NOERROR', DnsResponseCode == 3, 'NXDOMAIN', DnsResponseCode == 2, 'SERVFAIL', DnsResponseCode == 5, 'REFUSED', DnsResponseCode == 1, 'FORMERR', strcat('RCODE-', tostring(DnsResponseCode)))\r\n| summarize Queries = sum(EventCount) by RCodeName",
              "size": 1,
              "visualization": "piechart",
              "title": "Response code distribution",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ov-rc"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### DNS traffic heatmap & distribution"
            },
            "name": "ov-h2"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| summarize Queries = sum(EventCount) by Hour = hourofday(TimeGenerated), Dow = toint(dayofweek(TimeGenerated) / 1d)\r\n| extend DayName = case(Dow == 0, '0 Sun', Dow == 1, '1 Mon', Dow == 2, '2 Tue', Dow == 3, '3 Wed', Dow == 4, '4 Thu', Dow == 5, '5 Fri', '6 Sat')\r\n| project Hour, DayName, Queries\r\n| evaluate pivot(Hour, sum(Queries), DayName)\r\n| order by DayName asc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "DNS volume heatmap (day × hour of day)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "[0-9]",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ov-heat"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isnotempty(DnsQuery)\r\n| extend _labels = split(DnsQuery, '.')\r\n| extend Tld = tolower(tostring(_labels[array_length(_labels) - 1]))\r\n| where isnotempty(Tld)\r\n| summarize Queries = sum(EventCount) by Tld\r\n| top 15 by Queries desc",
              "size": 1,
              "visualization": "barchart",
              "title": "Top queried TLDs",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ov-tld"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isnotempty(SrcIpAddr)\r\n| extend Subnet = strcat(tostring(split(SrcIpAddr, '.')[0]), '.', tostring(split(SrcIpAddr, '.')[1]), '.', tostring(split(SrcIpAddr, '.')[2]), '.0/24')\r\n| summarize Queries = sum(EventCount), Clients = dcount(SrcIpAddr), NXDOMAIN = sumif(EventCount, DnsResponseCode == 3) by Subnet\r\n| top 20 by Queries desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "DNS volume by /24 subnet",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Queries",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "blue"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "NXDOMAIN",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ov-subnet"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "group-overview"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "selectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "telemetry"
      },
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## 📡 Telemetry Health & Data Quality\n\nIs your DNS pipeline complete? Spot silent DNS servers / connectors, ingestion drops, and ASIM normalization gaps before they blind your detections.",
              "style": "info"
            },
            "name": "tel-h"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| summarize Events = sum(EventCount), Sources = dcount(DvcHostname), GB = round(sum(_BilledSize) / 1073741824.0, 2), MinT = min(TimeGenerated), MaxT = max(TimeGenerated)\r\n| extend Hours = max_of((MaxT - MinT) / 1h, 1.0)\r\n| extend ['Events / hour (avg)'] = round(todouble(Events) / Hours, 0)\r\n| project ['Total Events'] = Events, ['Events / hour (avg)'], ['Sources Reporting'] = Sources, ['Ingestion GB'] = GB",
              "size": 2,
              "title": "Ingestion KPIs (selected range)",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "tel-kpi"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| summarize Events = sum(EventCount), LastEvent = max(TimeGenerated), FirstEvent = min(TimeGenerated) by DvcHostname\r\n| extend HoursSinceLast = round((now() - LastEvent) / 1h, 1)\r\n| extend Status = case(HoursSinceLast > 24, '🔴 Silent >24h', HoursSinceLast > 6, '🟠 Stale >6h', '🟢 Healthy')\r\n| project Status, DvcHostname, Events, LastEvent, HoursSinceLast, FirstEvent\r\n| order by HoursSinceLast desc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Source health (silent / stale sources)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Status",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "HoursSinceLast",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "tel-src"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| summarize Events = sum(EventCount) by bin(TimeGenerated, 1h), DvcHostname",
              "size": 0,
              "visualization": "timechart",
              "title": "Ingestion trend (events/hour by source)",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "tel-trend"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| summarize Total = sum(EventCount),\r\n            EmptyQuery = sumif(EventCount, isempty(DnsQuery)),\r\n            Failures = sumif(EventCount, EventResult =~ 'Failure')\r\n    by DvcHostname\r\n| extend EmptyPct = round(100.0 * EmptyQuery / Total, 2), FailPct = round(100.0 * Failures / Total, 2)\r\n| project DvcHostname, Total, EmptyQuery, EmptyPct, Failures, FailPct\r\n| order by EmptyPct desc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Parsing / normalization health (empty-query & failure %)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "EmptyPct",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "FailPct",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "tel-parse"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "group-telemetry"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "selectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "noise"
      },
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## 📈 Noisy Traffic — find the volume (and the cost)\n\nSpot chatty clients/domains you can exclude with a **data collection filter** to reduce ingestion cost.",
              "style": "info"
            },
            "name": "no-h"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| summarize Queries = sum(EventCount), UniqueDomains = dcount(DnsQuery),\r\n            NXDOMAIN = sumif(EventCount, DnsResponseCode == 3),\r\n            Country = any(SrcGeoCountry)\r\n    by SrcIpAddr\r\n| top 25 by Queries desc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Top talkers (clients)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Queries",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "blue"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "NXDOMAIN",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "no-clients"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isnotempty(DnsQuery)\r\n| summarize Queries = sum(EventCount), Clients = dcount(SrcIpAddr) by DnsQuery\r\n| top 25 by Queries desc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Top domains",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Queries",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "blue"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "no-domains"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| summarize Queries = sum(EventCount) by DnsQueryTypeName",
              "size": 1,
              "visualization": "piechart",
              "title": "Query-type distribution",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "no-qtypes"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where DnsQueryTypeName == 'PTR'\r\n| summarize ReverseLookups = sum(EventCount), Targets = dcount(DnsQuery) by SrcIpAddr\r\n| top 25 by ReverseLookups desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "PTR / reverse lookups (usually pure noise)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ReverseLookups",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "orange"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "no-ptr"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### 💰 Cost estimate (selected time range, raw ingestion)\n\nUnfiltered ingestion for `ASimDnsActivityLogs` over the **Time range** you pick above. Set **Price per GB** to your tier. The **PTR share** is usually your quickest data-collection-filter saving.",
              "style": "info"
            },
            "name": "no-costh"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let PricePerGB = todouble({PricePerGB});\r\nlet T = ASimDnsActivityLogs;\r\nlet tot = toscalar(T | summarize sum(_BilledSize));\r\nlet ptr = toscalar(T | where DnsQueryTypeName == 'PTR' | summarize sum(_BilledSize));\r\nlet days = toscalar(T | summarize MinT = min(TimeGenerated), MaxT = max(TimeGenerated) | extend d = max_of((MaxT - MinT) / 1d, 1.0) | project d);\r\nunion\r\n(print Metric = 'Total GB (range)', Value = round(tot / 1073741824.0, 2), Order = 1),\r\n(print Metric = 'GB / day', Value = round(tot / 1073741824.0 / days, 2), Order = 2),\r\n(print Metric = 'Est. cost (range, USD)', Value = round(tot / 1073741824.0 * PricePerGB, 2), Order = 3),\r\n(print Metric = 'PTR GB (range)', Value = round(ptr / 1073741824.0, 2), Order = 4),\r\n(print Metric = 'Est. PTR savings (USD)', Value = round(ptr / 1073741824.0 * PricePerGB, 2), Order = 5)\r\n| project Order, Metric, Value\r\n| sort by Order asc",
              "size": 3,
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "title": "Ingestion & estimated cost",
              "tileSettings": {
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Metric",
                  "formatter": 1
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Value",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "blue"
                  }
                },
                "showBorder": true
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "no-costkpi"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| summarize GB = round(sum(_BilledSize) / 1073741824.0, 3) by DnsQueryTypeName\r\n| top 15 by GB desc",
              "size": 1,
              "visualization": "barchart",
              "title": "GB by query type (what to exclude)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "GB",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "no-costtype"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| summarize GB = round(sum(_BilledSize) / 1073741824.0, 3), Events = sum(EventCount) by DnsQuery\r\n| top 20 by GB desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Top domains by ingested GB",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "GB",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "no-costdom"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "group-noise"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "selectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "behavioral"
      },
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## 🧭 Behavioral Analytics"
            },
            "name": "beh-h"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Record types & response codes"
            },
            "name": "beh-h1"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| summarize Queries = sum(EventCount), Clients = dcount(SrcIpAddr), Domains = dcount(DnsQuery) by DnsQueryTypeName\r\n| extend Risk = case(DnsQueryTypeName in ('TXT','NULL','ANY'), '🔴 Tunneling-prone', DnsQueryTypeName in ('CNAME','SRV','MX'), '🟡 Watch', '🟢 Normal')\r\n| project Risk, DnsQueryTypeName, Queries, Clients, Domains\r\n| order by Queries desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "DNS record-type monitoring (TXT/NULL/ANY highlighted)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Risk",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Queries",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "blue"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "beh-rt"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| extend RCodeName = case(DnsResponseCode == 0, 'NOERROR', DnsResponseCode == 3, 'NXDOMAIN', DnsResponseCode == 2, 'SERVFAIL', DnsResponseCode == 5, 'REFUSED', DnsResponseCode == 1, 'FORMERR', strcat('RCODE-', tostring(DnsResponseCode)))\r\n| summarize Queries = sum(EventCount) by RCodeName",
              "size": 1,
              "visualization": "piechart",
              "title": "Response-code distribution",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "beh-rc"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Query-length analytics"
            },
            "name": "beh-h2"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isnotempty(DnsQuery)\r\n| extend Len = strlen(DnsQuery)\r\n| summarize Avg = round(avg(Len), 1), Median = round(percentile(Len, 50), 0), P95 = round(percentile(Len, 95), 0), P99 = round(percentile(Len, 99), 0), Max = max(Len)\r\n| project ['Avg length'] = Avg, ['Median'] = Median, ['P95'] = P95, ['P99'] = P99, ['Max'] = Max",
              "size": 2,
              "title": "Query length (avg / median / P95 / P99 / max)",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "beh-lkpi"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isnotempty(DnsQuery)\r\n| extend Len = strlen(DnsQuery)\r\n| extend Bucket = case(Len < 20, '00-19', Len < 40, '20-39', Len < 60, '40-59', Len < 80, '60-79', Len < 100, '80-99', '100+')\r\n| summarize Queries = sum(EventCount) by Bucket\r\n| order by Bucket asc",
              "size": 1,
              "visualization": "barchart",
              "title": "Query-length histogram",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "beh-lhist"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Internal vs external & new activity"
            },
            "name": "beh-h3"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet _intRaw = '{InternalDomains}';\r\nlet _int = iif(_intRaw == '', dynamic([]), todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_intRaw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isnotempty(DnsQuery)\r\n| extend Scope = iff(array_length(_int) > 0 and DnsQuery has_any (_int), 'Internal', 'External')\r\n| summarize Queries = sum(EventCount), Clients = dcount(SrcIpAddr), Domains = dcount(DnsQuery) by Scope",
              "size": 1,
              "visualization": "piechart",
              "title": "Internal vs external DNS",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "beh-ie"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet baseline = ASimDnsActivityLogs | where TimeGenerated between (ago(30d) .. ago(1d)) | distinct SrcIpAddr;\r\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where TimeGenerated > ago(1d)\r\n| where isnotempty(SrcIpAddr)\r\n| where SrcIpAddr !in (baseline)\r\n| summarize Queries = sum(EventCount), Domains = dcount(DnsQuery), FirstSeen = min(TimeGenerated), Country = any(SrcGeoCountry) by SrcIpAddr\r\n| top 50 by Queries desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Top newly-active clients (first seen in last 24h)",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 2592000000.0
              }
            },
            "name": "beh-new"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet base = ASimDnsActivityLogs | where TimeGenerated between (ago(8d) .. ago(1d)) | summarize DailyAvg = sum(EventCount) / 7.0 by SrcIpAddr;\r\nlet cur = ASimDnsActivityLogs | where TimeGenerated > ago(1d) | summarize Today = sum(EventCount) by SrcIpAddr;\r\ncur\r\n| join kind=inner base on SrcIpAddr\r\n| extend IncreasePct = round(100.0 * (Today - DailyAvg) / DailyAvg, 0)\r\n| where DailyAvg >= 10 and IncreasePct >= 200\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = case(IncreasePct >= 500, '🔴 Critical', IncreasePct >= 300, '🟠 High', '🟡 Medium')\r\n| project ThreatLevel, SrcIpAddr, Today, DailyAvg = round(DailyAvg, 0), IncreasePct\r\n| order by IncreasePct desc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Client volume spike vs 7-day baseline (>= 200%)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "IncreasePct",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 2592000000.0
              }
            },
            "name": "beh-base"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet base = ASimDnsActivityLogs | where TimeGenerated between (ago(30d) .. ago(1h)) | summarize H = sum(EventCount) by bin(TimeGenerated, 1h) | summarize Avg = avg(H), Std = stdev(H);\r\nlet cur = ASimDnsActivityLogs | where TimeGenerated > ago(1h) | summarize Now = sum(EventCount);\r\ncur\r\n| extend Avg = toscalar(base | project Avg), Std = toscalar(base | project Std)\r\n| extend Deviation = round((Now - Avg) / Std, 1)\r\n| extend Status = case(Deviation >= 3, '🔴 Volume spike', Deviation <= -3, '🔴 Sudden drop (possible logging failure)', abs(Deviation) >= 2, '🟠 Unusual', '🟢 Normal')\r\n| project Status, ['Current hour events'] = Now, ['30d hourly avg'] = round(Avg, 0), StdDev = round(Std, 0), ['Deviation (sigma)'] = Deviation",
              "size": 2,
              "title": "Query-volume anomaly (current hour vs 30d) — spikes & sudden drops",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 2592000000.0
              }
            },
            "name": "beh-anom"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "group-behavioral"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "selectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "malicious"
      },
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## 🚨 Suspicious and Malicious DNS activity"
            },
            "name": "ma-h"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Malicious traffic summary (client IP · DNS server)"
            },
            "name": "ma-sum"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet SuspiciousTlds = dynamic(['zip','mov','xyz','top','gq','tk','ml','cf','ga','work','click','country','kim','science','party','review','loan','download','stream','racing','fit','cam','rest','mom']);\r\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| extend _len = strlen(DnsQuery)\r\n| extend _labels = split(DnsQuery, '.')\r\n| extend _tld = tolower(tostring(_labels[array_length(_labels) - 1]))\r\n| extend IsMalicious = (DnsResponseCode == 3) or (_len >= 50) or (DnsQueryTypeName in ('TXT','NULL')) or (_tld in (SuspiciousTlds))\r\n| extend MalEvents = iff(IsMalicious, EventCount, 0)\r\n| summarize Total = sum(EventCount), Malicious = sum(MalEvents),\r\n            AffectedClients = dcountif(SrcIpAddr, IsMalicious), MaliciousDomains = dcountif(DnsQuery, IsMalicious)\r\n| extend ['Malicious %'] = round(100.0 * Malicious / Total, 2)\r\n| project ['Malicious Queries'] = Malicious, ['Malicious %'], ['Affected Clients'] = AffectedClients, ['Malicious Domains'] = MaliciousDomains",
              "size": 2,
              "title": "Malicious traffic overview",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ma-kpi"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet SuspiciousTlds = dynamic(['zip','mov','xyz','top','gq','tk','ml','cf','ga','work','click','country','kim','science','party','review','loan','download','stream','racing','fit','cam','rest','mom']);\r\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| extend _len = strlen(DnsQuery)\r\n| extend _labels = split(DnsQuery, '.')\r\n| extend _tld = tolower(tostring(_labels[array_length(_labels) - 1]))\r\n| extend IsMalicious = (DnsResponseCode == 3) or (_len >= 50) or (DnsQueryTypeName in ('TXT','NULL')) or (_tld in (SuspiciousTlds))\r\n| extend MalEvents = iff(IsMalicious, EventCount, 0)\r\n| summarize TotalQueries = sum(EventCount), MaliciousQueries = sum(MalEvents),\r\n            MaliciousDomains = dcountif(DnsQuery, IsMalicious), Country = any(SrcGeoCountry)\r\n    by SrcIpAddr\r\n| where MaliciousQueries > 0\r\n| extend MaliciousPct = round(100.0 * MaliciousQueries / TotalQueries, 1)\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = case(MaliciousQueries >= 500, '🔴 Critical', MaliciousQueries >= 100, '🟠 High', MaliciousQueries >= 20, '🟡 Medium', '🟢 Low')\r\n| project ThreatLevel, SrcIpAddr, Country, TotalQueries, MaliciousQueries, MaliciousPct, MaliciousDomains\r\n| top 50 by MaliciousQueries desc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Malicious traffic by client IP",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "MaliciousQueries",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "MaliciousPct",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ma-byip"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet SuspiciousTlds = dynamic(['zip','mov','xyz','top','gq','tk','ml','cf','ga','work','click','country','kim','science','party','review','loan','download','stream','racing','fit','cam','rest','mom']);\r\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| extend _len = strlen(DnsQuery)\r\n| extend _labels = split(DnsQuery, '.')\r\n| extend _tld = tolower(tostring(_labels[array_length(_labels) - 1]))\r\n| extend IsMalicious = (DnsResponseCode == 3) or (_len >= 50) or (DnsQueryTypeName in ('TXT','NULL')) or (_tld in (SuspiciousTlds))\r\n| extend MalEvents = iff(IsMalicious, EventCount, 0)\r\n| where isnotempty(DvcHostname)\r\n| summarize TotalQueries = sum(EventCount), MaliciousQueries = sum(MalEvents), Clients = dcount(SrcIpAddr)\r\n    by DvcHostname\r\n| where MaliciousQueries > 0\r\n| extend MaliciousPct = round(100.0 * MaliciousQueries / TotalQueries, 1)\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = case(MaliciousPct >= 20, '🔴 Critical', MaliciousPct >= 5, '🟠 High', '🟡 Medium')\r\n| project ThreatLevel, DvcHostname, TotalQueries, MaliciousQueries, MaliciousPct, Clients\r\n| top 25 by MaliciousQueries desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Malicious traffic by DNS server",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "MaliciousQueries",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ma-bydev"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### DGA / recon — clients with many failed (NXDOMAIN) lookups"
            },
            "name": "ma-h1"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where DnsResponseCode == 3\r\n| summarize FailedQueries = sum(EventCount), DistinctFailedDomains = dcount(DnsQuery),\r\n            SampleDomains = make_set(DnsQuery, 10), Country = any(SrcGeoCountry)\r\n    by SrcIpAddr\r\n| where DistinctFailedDomains >= toint({NXDOMAINThreshold})\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = case(DistinctFailedDomains >= 500, '🔴 Critical',\r\n                            DistinctFailedDomains >= 200, '🟠 High',\r\n                            DistinctFailedDomains >= toint({NXDOMAINThreshold}) * 2, '🟡 Medium',\r\n                            '🟢 Low')\r\n| project ThreatLevel, SrcIpAddr, Country, FailedQueries, DistinctFailedDomains, SampleDomains\r\n| order by DistinctFailedDomains desc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "High NXDOMAIN clients",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "DistinctFailedDomains",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ma-nx"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### DNS tunneling / exfiltration"
            },
            "name": "ma-h2"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isnotempty(DnsQuery)\r\n| extend QueryLength = strlen(DnsQuery)\r\n| where QueryLength >= toint({QueryLenThreshold})\r\n| summarize Requests = sum(EventCount), MaxLength = max(QueryLength), SampleQuery = any(DnsQuery)\r\n    by SrcIpAddr, DnsQueryTypeName\r\n| where Requests >= 10\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = case(MaxLength >= 150, '🔴 Critical', MaxLength >= 90, '🟠 High', '🟡 Medium')\r\n| project ThreatLevel, SrcIpAddr, DnsQueryTypeName, Requests, MaxLength, SampleQuery\r\n| order by MaxLength desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Abnormally long query names",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "MaxLength",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ma-long"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isnotempty(DnsQuery)\r\n| extend labels = split(DnsQuery, '.')\r\n| where array_length(labels) >= 3\r\n| extend ParentDomain = strcat(tostring(labels[array_length(labels) - 2]), '.', tostring(labels[array_length(labels) - 1]))\r\n| summarize UniqueSubdomains = dcount(DnsQuery), Requests = sum(EventCount), Clients = dcount(SrcIpAddr) by ParentDomain\r\n| where UniqueSubdomains >= toint({SubdomainThreshold})\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = case(UniqueSubdomains >= toint({SubdomainThreshold}) * 5, '🔴 Critical',\r\n                            UniqueSubdomains >= toint({SubdomainThreshold}) * 2, '🟠 High',\r\n                            '🟡 Medium')\r\n| project ThreatLevel, ParentDomain, UniqueSubdomains, Requests, Clients\r\n| order by UniqueSubdomains desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Excessive unique subdomains per parent domain",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "UniqueSubdomains",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ma-sub"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where DnsQueryTypeName in ('TXT', 'NULL', 'CNAME')\r\n| summarize Requests = sum(EventCount), UniqueDomains = dcount(DnsQuery), SampleDomains = make_set(DnsQuery, 10)\r\n    by SrcIpAddr, DnsQueryTypeName\r\n| where Requests >= toint({TunnelRecordThreshold})\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = case(Requests >= toint({TunnelRecordThreshold}) * 10, '🔴 Critical',\r\n                            Requests >= toint({TunnelRecordThreshold}) * 4, '🟠 High',\r\n                            '🟡 Medium')\r\n| project ThreatLevel, SrcIpAddr, DnsQueryTypeName, Requests, UniqueDomains, SampleDomains\r\n| order by Requests desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "TXT / NULL / CNAME record abuse (C2 channels)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Requests",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ma-txt"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Algorithmic / suspicious domains"
            },
            "name": "ma-h3"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where DnsQueryTypeName in ('A', 'AAAA')\r\n| where isnotempty(DnsQuery)\r\n| extend Host = tolower(tostring(split(DnsQuery, '.')[0]))\r\n| extend HostLen = strlen(Host)\r\n| where HostLen >= 10\r\n| extend DigitCount = array_length(extract_all(@'([0-9])', Host))\r\n| extend DigitRatio = round(todouble(DigitCount) / todouble(HostLen), 2)\r\n| where DigitRatio >= todouble({DigitRatioThreshold}) or HostLen >= 20\r\n| summarize Requests = sum(EventCount), Clients = dcount(SrcIpAddr) by DnsQuery, HostLen, DigitRatio\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = case(DigitRatio >= 0.5 or HostLen >= 30, '🔴 Critical',\r\n                            DigitRatio >= todouble({DigitRatioThreshold}) or HostLen >= 20, '🟠 High',\r\n                            '🟡 Medium')\r\n| project ThreatLevel, DnsQuery, HostLen, DigitRatio, Requests, Clients\r\n| order by Requests desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Possible DGA hosts (long / high digit-ratio labels)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "DigitRatio",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ma-dga"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet Hosts = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    | where DnsQueryTypeName in ('A', 'AAAA')\r\n    | where isnotempty(DnsQuery)\r\n    | extend Host = tolower(tostring(split(DnsQuery, '.')[0]))\r\n    | where strlen(Host) >= 8\r\n    | summarize Requests = sum(EventCount), Clients = dcount(SrcIpAddr) by DnsQuery, Host;\r\nHosts\r\n| extend HostLen = strlen(Host)\r\n| mv-expand ch = extract_all(@'(.)', Host) to typeof(string)\r\n| summarize CharCount = count(), Requests = any(Requests), Clients = any(Clients), HostLen = any(HostLen) by DnsQuery, Host, ch\r\n| extend p = todouble(CharCount) / todouble(HostLen)\r\n| summarize Entropy = round(-sum(p * log2(p)), 2), Requests = any(Requests), Clients = any(Clients), HostLen = any(HostLen) by DnsQuery, Host\r\n| where Entropy >= todouble({EntropyThreshold})\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = case(Entropy >= 4.0, '🔴 Critical', Entropy >= 3.5, '🟠 High', '🟡 Medium')\r\n| project ThreatLevel, DnsQuery, HostLen, Entropy, Requests, Clients\r\n| top 50 by Entropy desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "High-entropy domains (Shannon entropy)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Entropy",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ma-entropy"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet SuspiciousTlds = dynamic(['zip','mov','xyz','top','gq','tk','ml','cf','ga','work','click','country','kim','science','party','review','loan','download','stream','racing','fit','cam','rest','mom']);\r\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isnotempty(DnsQuery)\r\n| extend labels = split(DnsQuery, '.')\r\n| extend Tld = tolower(tostring(labels[array_length(labels) - 1]))\r\n| where Tld in (SuspiciousTlds)\r\n| summarize Requests = sum(EventCount), Clients = dcount(SrcIpAddr), SampleDomains = make_set(DnsQuery, 10) by Tld\r\n| order by Requests desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Queries to suspicious / abused TLDs",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Requests",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "orange"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ma-tld"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet HighRisk = dynamic(['top','xyz','icu','zip','mov','gq','tk','ml','cf','ga','work','click','loan','download','stream','racing','fit','cam','rest','mom','country','kim','science','party','review','support','date','win','bid','trade']);\r\nlet LowRisk = dynamic(['com','net','org','edu','gov','mil','io','co']);\r\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isnotempty(DnsQuery)\r\n| extend _labels = split(DnsQuery, '.')\r\n| extend Tld = tolower(tostring(_labels[array_length(_labels) - 1]))\r\n| where isnotempty(Tld)\r\n| summarize Queries = sum(EventCount), Devices = dcount(SrcIpAddr) by Tld\r\n| extend RiskClass = case(Tld in (HighRisk), '🔴 Higher-risk', Tld in (LowRisk), '🟢 Low-risk', '🟡 Uncommon')\r\n| project RiskClass, Tld, Queries, Devices\r\n| order by RiskClass asc, Queries desc\r\n| take 40",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "TLD risk classification (low / uncommon / higher-risk)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "RiskClass",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Queries",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "orange"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ma-tldrisk"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Beaconing, Dynamic DNS & Fast Flux (C2 infrastructure)"
            },
            "name": "ma-h6"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isnotempty(DnsQuery)\r\n| where DnsQueryTypeName in ('A','AAAA','TXT','CNAME','NULL')\r\n| summarize Hits = sum(EventCount), Times = make_list(TimeGenerated, 1000) by SrcIpAddr, DnsQuery\r\n| where Hits >= 12\r\n| mv-apply Ts = Times to typeof(datetime) on (\r\n    order by Ts asc\r\n    | extend d = datetime_diff('second', Ts, prev(Ts))\r\n    | where isnotnull(d) and d > 0\r\n    | summarize AvgInterval = avg(d), StdInterval = stdev(d), Samples = count()\r\n  )\r\n| where Samples >= 10 and AvgInterval between (30.0 .. 86400.0)\r\n| extend CV = round(StdInterval / AvgInterval, 2)\r\n| where CV <= 0.15\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = case(CV <= 0.05, '🔴 Critical', CV <= 0.10, '🟠 High', '🟡 Medium')\r\n| project ThreatLevel, SrcIpAddr, DnsQuery, Hits, AvgIntervalSec = round(AvgInterval, 0), RegularityCV = CV, Samples\r\n| order by RegularityCV asc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Beaconing candidates (regular-interval DNS to same domain)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "RegularityCV",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ma-beacon"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet DynProviders = dynamic(['duckdns.org','no-ip.','noip.com','dynu.com','afraid.org','ddns.net','hopto.org','zapto.org','sytes.net','servebeer.com','ngrok.io','freedns','changeip.com','dyndns.org','myftp.','serveftp.','redirectme.net']);\r\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isnotempty(DnsQuery)\r\n| where tolower(DnsQuery) has_any (DynProviders)\r\n| summarize Requests = sum(EventCount), Clients = dcount(SrcIpAddr) by DnsQuery\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = '🟠 High'\r\n| project ThreatLevel, DnsQuery, Requests, Clients\r\n| top 50 by Requests desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Dynamic DNS provider queries",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Requests",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "orange"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ma-dyndns"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isnotempty(DnsQuery) and isnotempty(DstIpAddr)\r\n| summarize DistinctIPs = dcount(DstIpAddr), IPs = make_set(DstIpAddr, 20), Requests = sum(EventCount), Clients = dcount(SrcIpAddr) by DnsQuery\r\n| where DistinctIPs >= 10\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = case(DistinctIPs >= 50, '🔴 Critical', DistinctIPs >= 20, '🟠 High', '🟡 Medium')\r\n| project ThreatLevel, DnsQuery, DistinctIPs, Requests, Clients, IPs\r\n| order by DistinctIPs desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Fast flux (one domain resolving to many IPs)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "DistinctIPs",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ma-fastflux"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Server attacks & first-seen indicators"
            },
            "name": "ma-h4"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where DnsQueryTypeName in ('AXFR', 'IXFR')\r\n| summarize Requests = sum(EventCount) by SrcIpAddr, DnsQuery, DvcHostname\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = '🔴 Critical'\r\n| project ThreatLevel, SrcIpAddr, DnsQuery, DvcHostname, Requests\r\n| order by Requests desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Zone transfer attempts (AXFR / IXFR)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ma-axfr"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet baseline = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    | where TimeGenerated between (ago(30d) .. ago(1d))\r\n    | distinct DnsQuery;\r\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where TimeGenerated > ago(1d)\r\n| where isnotempty(DnsQuery)\r\n| where DnsQuery !in (baseline)\r\n| summarize Requests = sum(EventCount), Clients = dcount(SrcIpAddr), FirstSeen = min(TimeGenerated) by DnsQuery\r\n| top 50 by Requests desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Newly observed domains (last 24h vs 30-day baseline)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Requests",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "orange"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContext": {
                "durationMs": 2592000000.0
              }
            },
            "name": "ma-new"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isnotempty(DnsQuery)\r\n| summarize Clients = dcount(SrcIpAddr), Requests = sum(EventCount), Client = any(SrcIpAddr) by DnsQuery\r\n| where Clients == 1 and Requests >= 20\r\n| top 50 by Requests desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Rare domains (queried by a single client)",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ma-rare"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### 🔎 Domain drill-down (use the \"Domain contains\" box above)"
            },
            "name": "ma-h5"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isnotempty(DnsQuery)\r\n| where isempty('{DomainSearch}') or DnsQuery has '{DomainSearch}'\r\n| extend RCodeName = case(DnsResponseCode == 0, 'NOERROR', DnsResponseCode == 3, 'NXDOMAIN', DnsResponseCode == 2, 'SERVFAIL', DnsResponseCode == 5, 'REFUSED', DnsResponseCode == 1, 'FORMERR', strcat('RCODE-', tostring(DnsResponseCode)))\r\n| summarize Requests = sum(EventCount), Clients = dcount(SrcIpAddr),\r\n            QueryTypes = make_set(DnsQueryTypeName, 10), ResponseCodes = make_set(RCodeName, 10),\r\n            FirstSeen = min(TimeGenerated), LastSeen = max(TimeGenerated)\r\n    by DnsQuery\r\n| top 100 by Requests desc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Domain drill-down",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ma-drill"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "group-malicious"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "selectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "geo"
      },
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## 🌍 Geolocation of DNS traffic\n\nSource geography of DNS clients. The **country map** is shaded green→red by the share of malicious queries; the **bubble map** plots malicious hotspots by city. Only public / geo-resolvable source IPs appear (internal RFC1918 clients have no geo).",
              "style": "info"
            },
            "name": "geo-h"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet SuspiciousTlds = dynamic(['zip','mov','xyz','top','gq','tk','ml','cf','ga','work','click','country','kim','science','party','review','loan','download','stream','racing','fit','cam','rest','mom']);\r\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| extend _len = strlen(DnsQuery)\r\n| extend _labels = split(DnsQuery, '.')\r\n| extend _tld = tolower(tostring(_labels[array_length(_labels) - 1]))\r\n| extend IsMalicious = (DnsResponseCode == 3) or (_len >= 50) or (DnsQueryTypeName in ('TXT','NULL')) or (_tld in (SuspiciousTlds))\r\n| extend MalEvents = iff(IsMalicious, EventCount, 0)\r\n| where isnotempty(SrcGeoCountry)\r\n| summarize TotalQueries = sum(EventCount), MaliciousQueries = sum(MalEvents), Clients = dcount(SrcIpAddr)\r\n    by SrcGeoCountry\r\n| extend MaliciousPct = round(100.0 * MaliciousQueries / TotalQueries, 1)",
              "size": 0,
              "visualization": "map",
              "title": "DNS traffic by source country (color = % malicious)",
              "mapSettings": {
                "labelSettings": "SrcGeoCountry",
                "locInfoColumn": "SrcGeoCountry",
                "minSize": 0,
                "itemColorSettings": {
                  "nodeColorField": "MaliciousPct",
                  "colorAggregation": "Max",
                  "type": "thresholds",
                  "thresholdsGrid": [
                    {
                      "operator": ">=",
                      "thresholdValue": "20",
                      "representation": "red",
                      "text": "{0}{1} malicious (Critical)"
                    },
                    {
                      "operator": ">=",
                      "thresholdValue": "5",
                      "representation": "orange",
                      "text": "{0}{1} malicious (Elevated)"
                    },
                    {
                      "operator": ">=",
                      "thresholdValue": "0",
                      "representation": "green",
                      "text": "{0}{1} malicious (Low)"
                    },
                    {
                      "operator": "Default",
                      "thresholdValue": "",
                      "representation": "gray",
                      "text": "No data"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "sizeSettings": "TotalQueries",
                "locInfo": "CountryRegion",
                "sizeAggregation": "Sum",
                "legendMetric": "TotalQueries",
                "legendAggregation": "Sum"
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "geo-country"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet SuspiciousTlds = dynamic(['zip','mov','xyz','top','gq','tk','ml','cf','ga','work','click','country','kim','science','party','review','loan','download','stream','racing','fit','cam','rest','mom']);\r\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| extend _len = strlen(DnsQuery)\r\n| extend _labels = split(DnsQuery, '.')\r\n| extend _tld = tolower(tostring(_labels[array_length(_labels) - 1]))\r\n| extend IsMalicious = (DnsResponseCode == 3) or (_len >= 50) or (DnsQueryTypeName in ('TXT','NULL')) or (_tld in (SuspiciousTlds))\r\n| extend MalEvents = iff(IsMalicious, EventCount, 0)\r\n| where isnotnull(SrcGeoLatitude) and isnotnull(SrcGeoLongitude)\r\n| where not(SrcGeoLatitude == 0 and SrcGeoLongitude == 0)\r\n| where IsMalicious\r\n| summarize MaliciousQueries = sum(EventCount), Clients = dcount(SrcIpAddr),\r\n            Lat = any(SrcGeoLatitude), Lon = any(SrcGeoLongitude)\r\n    by SrcGeoCountry, SrcGeoCity\r\n| where MaliciousQueries > 0\r\n| top 200 by MaliciousQueries desc",
              "size": 0,
              "visualization": "map",
              "title": "🔴 Malicious DNS hotspots by city",
              "mapSettings": {
                "labelSettings": "SrcGeoCity",
                "itemColorSettings": {
                  "type": "heatmap",
                  "colorAggregation": "Sum",
                  "nodeColorField": "MaliciousQueries",
                  "heatmapPalette": "redGreen"
                },
                "minSize": 0,
                "longitude": "Lon",
                "sizeSettings": "MaliciousQueries",
                "locInfo": "LatLong",
                "latitude": "Lat",
                "sizeAggregation": "Sum",
                "legendMetric": "MaliciousQueries",
                "legendAggregation": "Sum"
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "geo-bubble"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet SuspiciousTlds = dynamic(['zip','mov','xyz','top','gq','tk','ml','cf','ga','work','click','country','kim','science','party','review','loan','download','stream','racing','fit','cam','rest','mom']);\r\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| extend _len = strlen(DnsQuery)\r\n| extend _labels = split(DnsQuery, '.')\r\n| extend _tld = tolower(tostring(_labels[array_length(_labels) - 1]))\r\n| extend IsMalicious = (DnsResponseCode == 3) or (_len >= 50) or (DnsQueryTypeName in ('TXT','NULL')) or (_tld in (SuspiciousTlds))\r\n| extend MalEvents = iff(IsMalicious, EventCount, 0)\r\n| where isnotempty(SrcGeoCountry)\r\n| summarize TotalQueries = sum(EventCount), MaliciousQueries = sum(MalEvents), Clients = dcount(SrcIpAddr),\r\n            TopMaliciousDomains = make_set_if(DnsQuery, IsMalicious, 8)\r\n    by SrcGeoCountry, SrcGeoCity\r\n| extend MaliciousPct = round(100.0 * MaliciousQueries / TotalQueries, 1)\r\n| where MaliciousQueries > 0\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = case(MaliciousPct >= 30, '🔴 Critical', MaliciousPct >= 10, '🟠 High', MaliciousPct >= 1, '🟡 Medium', '🟢 Low')\r\n| project ThreatLevel, SrcGeoCountry, SrcGeoCity, TotalQueries, MaliciousQueries, MaliciousPct, Clients, TopMaliciousDomains\r\n| top 50 by MaliciousQueries desc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Top source geographies by malicious volume",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "MaliciousQueries",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "MaliciousPct",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "geo-table"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "group-geo"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "selectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "ti"
      },
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## 🎯 Threat Intelligence — DNS queries to known-bad domains\n\nMatches DNS queries **within the selected Time range** against active domain/hostname indicators in **ThreatIntelIndicators** (STIX 2.1). Requires a Threat Intelligence connector.",
              "style": "info"
            },
            "name": "ti-h"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet TIDomains = ThreatIntelIndicators\r\n    | where IsActive == true and Revoked == false\r\n    | where ObservableKey in~ ('domain-name:value', 'hostname:value')\r\n    | where isnotempty(ObservableValue)\r\n    | summarize by TIDomain = tolower(ObservableValue);\r\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isnotempty(DnsQuery)\r\n| extend q = tolower(DnsQuery)\r\n| join kind=inner (TIDomains) on $left.q == $right.TIDomain\r\n| summarize Requests = sum(EventCount), Clients = make_set(SrcIpAddr, 20),\r\n            FirstSeen = min(TimeGenerated), LastSeen = max(TimeGenerated)\r\n    by DnsQuery\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = '🔴 Critical'\r\n| project ThreatLevel, DnsQuery, Requests, Clients, FirstSeen, LastSeen\r\n| order by LastSeen desc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "DNS queries matching TI domain indicators",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Requests",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ti-match"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet TIDomains = ThreatIntelIndicators\r\n    | where IsActive == true and Revoked == false\r\n    | where ObservableKey in~ ('domain-name:value', 'hostname:value')\r\n    | where isnotempty(ObservableValue)\r\n    | summarize by TIDomain = tolower(ObservableValue);\r\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| extend q = tolower(DnsQuery)\r\n| join kind=inner (TIDomains) on $left.q == $right.TIDomain\r\n| summarize Hits = sum(EventCount) by bin(TimeGenerated, 6h)",
              "size": 1,
              "visualization": "timechart",
              "title": "TI match hits over time",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ti-timeline"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### 🩸 IOC IP hits & infected devices"
            },
            "name": "ti-h2"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet TIips = ThreatIntelIndicators\r\n    | where IsActive == true and Revoked == false\r\n    | where ObservableKey =~ 'ipv4-addr:value'\r\n    | where isnotempty(ObservableValue)\r\n    | summarize by TIip = ObservableValue;\r\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isnotempty(DstIpAddr)\r\n| join kind=inner (TIips) on $left.DstIpAddr == $right.TIip\r\n| summarize Requests = sum(EventCount), Domains = make_set(DnsQuery, 10), Clients = make_set(SrcIpAddr, 20),\r\n            FirstSeen = min(TimeGenerated), LastSeen = max(TimeGenerated) by DstIpAddr\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = '🔴 Critical'\r\n| project ThreatLevel, ResolvedIP = DstIpAddr, Requests, Domains, Clients, FirstSeen, LastSeen\r\n| order by LastSeen desc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "DNS resolving to threat-intel IPs (DstIpAddr)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Requests",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ti-iphits"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet TIdom = ThreatIntelIndicators | where IsActive == true and Revoked == false | where ObservableKey in~ ('domain-name:value','hostname:value') | summarize by v = tolower(ObservableValue);\r\nlet TIip = ThreatIntelIndicators | where IsActive == true and Revoked == false | where ObservableKey =~ 'ipv4-addr:value' | summarize by v = ObservableValue;\r\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| extend _dommatch = tolower(DnsQuery) in (TIdom), _ipmatch = DstIpAddr in (TIip)\r\n| where _dommatch or _ipmatch\r\n| summarize IOCHits = sum(EventCount), IOCDomains = make_set_if(DnsQuery, _dommatch, 10), IOCIPs = make_set_if(DstIpAddr, _ipmatch, 10),\r\n            FirstSeen = min(TimeGenerated), LastSeen = max(TimeGenerated) by SrcIpAddr, SrcGeoCountry\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = '🔴 Critical'\r\n| project ThreatLevel, InfectedClient = SrcIpAddr, Country = SrcGeoCountry, IOCHits, IOCDomains, IOCIPs, FirstSeen, LastSeen\r\n| order by IOCHits desc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Infected devices (domain or IP IOC hits)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "IOCHits",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ti-infected"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### 🔎 Threat-intel indicator lookup (use the search box above)"
            },
            "name": "ti-h3"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "ThreatIntelIndicators\r\n| where IsActive == true and Revoked == false\r\n| where ObservableKey in~ ('domain-name:value','hostname:value','ipv4-addr:value')\r\n| where isempty('{IPorDomainSearch}') or ObservableValue has '{IPorDomainSearch}'\r\n| extend Type = case(ObservableKey has 'ipv4', 'IP', ObservableKey has 'domain', 'Domain', ObservableKey has 'hostname', 'Hostname', 'Other')\r\n| project Indicator = ObservableValue, Type, Confidence, ThreatType = tostring(Data.indicator_types), Description = tostring(Data.description), ValidUntil, Tags\r\n| order by Confidence desc\r\n| take 200",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "ThreatIntelIndicators — domain & IP reference",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Confidence",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "blue"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ti-lookup"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### 🎭 Threat actors that abuse DNS\n\nReference of known actors using DNS tunneling / DGA / DNS C2, plus a check of whether **your** environment shows indicators attributed to them (via ThreatIntelIndicators tags)."
            },
            "name": "ti-h4"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "datatable(Actor:string, Aliases:string, DnsTradecraft:string, MitreID:string)\r\n[\r\n 'APT41', 'Barium / Wicked Panda', 'DNS tunneling, DGA, DoH C2', 'T1071.004',\r\n 'APT28', 'Fancy Bear / Sofacy', 'DNS-based C2, fast flux', 'T1071.004',\r\n 'APT29', 'Cozy Bear / Midnight Blizzard', 'DGA, DNS tunneling, cloud C2', 'T1568.002',\r\n 'OilRig', 'APT34 / Helix Kitten', 'Helminth / ALMA / DNSExfiltrator tunneling', 'T1048.001',\r\n 'Turla', 'Snake / Venomous Bear', 'DNS backdoors, TXT-record C2', 'T1071.004',\r\n 'Sea Turtle', 'Teal Kurma', 'DNS hijacking, malicious NS/PTR', 'T1584.002',\r\n 'Lazarus', 'Hidden Cobra', 'DGA, DNS C2 in loaders', 'T1568.002',\r\n 'FIN7', 'Carbanak', 'DNS tunneling for exfiltration', 'T1048',\r\n 'DarkHydrus', '-', 'RogueRobin DNS-tunnel PowerShell C2', 'T1071.004',\r\n 'xHunt', '-', 'Snugy / BumbleBee DNS-tunnel backdoors', 'T1071.004'\r\n]\r\n| project Actor, Aliases, DnsTradecraft, MitreID",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Threat actors known to abuse DNS (reference)",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ti-actors"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet ActorIndicators = ThreatIntelIndicators\r\n    | where IsActive == true and Revoked == false\r\n    | where ObservableKey in~ ('domain-name:value','hostname:value')\r\n    | where isnotempty(ObservableValue)\r\n    | where isnotempty(Tags)\r\n    | project TIDomain = tolower(ObservableValue), Actor = tostring(Tags), ThreatType = tostring(Data.indicator_types);\r\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isnotempty(DnsQuery)\r\n| extend q = tolower(DnsQuery)\r\n| join kind=inner (ActorIndicators) on $left.q == $right.TIDomain\r\n| summarize Requests = sum(EventCount), Clients = make_set(SrcIpAddr, 20), Domains = make_set(DnsQuery, 10), LastSeen = max(TimeGenerated) by Actor, ThreatType\r\n| extend Affected = '🔴 AFFECTED'\r\n| project Affected, Actor, ThreatType, Requests, Clients, Domains, LastSeen\r\n| order by Requests desc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "🔴 Actor-attributed IOCs seen in YOUR DNS (are we affected?)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Affected",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Requests",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ti-affected"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### 🌐 Top malicious URLs & environment impact\n\nTop malicious **URL** indicators from **ThreatIntelIndicators** (active, non-revoked), plus whether any were actually seen in your **proxy/firewall (CommonSecurityLog)** or **endpoint (DeviceNetworkEvents)** traffic. **Honours the Time range** — widen it (e.g. 90 days) if your TI feed refreshes less often."
            },
            "name": "ti-h5"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "ThreatIntelIndicators\r\n| where IsActive == true and Revoked == false\r\n| where ObservableKey == 'url:value'\r\n| where isempty('{IPorDomainSearch}') or ObservableValue has '{IPorDomainSearch}'\r\n| summarize Indicators = count(), LastSeen = max(TimeGenerated), MaxConfidence = max(Confidence), Feeds = make_set(SourceSystem, 5) by Url = ObservableValue, ThreatType = tostring(Data.indicator_types)\r\n| order by MaxConfidence desc, Indicators desc\r\n| take 50",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "🔗 Top malicious URLs (threat-intel feed)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "MaxConfidence",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ti-malurls"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let MalUrls = ThreatIntelIndicators\r\n    | where IsActive == true and Revoked == false\r\n    | where ObservableKey == 'url:value'\r\n    | where isnotempty(ObservableValue)\r\n    | project TIUrl = tolower(ObservableValue), Confidence;\r\nCommonSecurityLog\r\n| where isnotempty(RequestURL)\r\n| extend u = tolower(RequestURL)\r\n| join kind=inner (MalUrls) on $left.u == $right.TIUrl\r\n| summarize Hits = count(), Clients = make_set(SourceIP, 20), Users = make_set(SourceUserName, 10), LastSeen = max(TimeGenerated), MaxConfidence = max(Confidence) by MaliciousUrl = RequestURL, DeviceProduct, Action = DeviceAction\r\n| extend Impact = '🔴 SEEN IN PROXY'\r\n| project Impact, MaliciousUrl, Hits, Clients, Users, Action, DeviceProduct, MaxConfidence, LastSeen\r\n| order by Hits desc\r\n| take 100",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "🔴 Malicious URLs seen in proxy/firewall (CommonSecurityLog)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Impact",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Hits",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ti-malurl-proxy"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let MalUrls = ThreatIntelIndicators\r\n    | where IsActive == true and Revoked == false\r\n    | where ObservableKey == 'url:value'\r\n    | where isnotempty(ObservableValue)\r\n    | project TIUrl = tolower(ObservableValue), Confidence;\r\nDeviceNetworkEvents\r\n| where isnotempty(RemoteUrl)\r\n| extend u = tolower(RemoteUrl)\r\n| join kind=inner (MalUrls) on $left.u == $right.TIUrl\r\n| summarize Hits = count(), Devices = make_set(DeviceName, 20), Processes = make_set(InitiatingProcessFileName, 10), LastSeen = max(TimeGenerated), MaxConfidence = max(Confidence) by MaliciousUrl = RemoteUrl, ActionType\r\n| extend Impact = '🔴 SEEN ON ENDPOINT'\r\n| project Impact, MaliciousUrl, Hits, Devices, Processes, ActionType, MaxConfidence, LastSeen\r\n| order by Hits desc\r\n| take 100",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "🔴 Malicious URLs seen on endpoints (DeviceNetworkEvents)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Impact",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Hits",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "ti-malurl-mde"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "group-ti"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "selectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "alerts"
      },
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## 🔔 Security Alerts & Incidents\n\nDNS-related **SecurityAlert** and open **SecurityIncident** records. Type an IP or domain in **Alert / IOC search** above to pivot to any alert/incident referencing it.",
              "style": "info"
            },
            "name": "al-h"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _s = '{IPorDomainSearch}';\r\nlet DnsTerms = dynamic(['DNS','domain generation','tunnel','beacon','exfiltrat','command and control','DGA','NXDOMAIN','C2']);\r\nSecurityAlert\r\n| where (isempty(_s) and (AlertName has_any (DnsTerms) or Description has_any (DnsTerms) or ProductName has 'DNS'))\r\n     or (isnotempty(_s) and (Entities has _s or ExtendedProperties has _s or AlertName has _s or Description has _s))\r\n| summarize Alerts = count() by AlertSeverity",
              "size": 1,
              "visualization": "barchart",
              "title": "Alerts by severity",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "al-sev"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _s = '{IPorDomainSearch}';\r\nlet DnsTerms = dynamic(['DNS','domain generation','tunnel','beacon','exfiltrat','command and control','DGA','NXDOMAIN','C2']);\r\nSecurityAlert\r\n| where (isempty(_s) and (AlertName has_any (DnsTerms) or Description has_any (DnsTerms) or ProductName has 'DNS'))\r\n     or (isnotempty(_s) and (Entities has _s or ExtendedProperties has _s or AlertName has _s or Description has _s))\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = case(AlertSeverity =~ 'High', '🔴 High', AlertSeverity =~ 'Medium', '🟠 Medium', AlertSeverity =~ 'Low', '🟡 Low', '🟢 Info')\r\n| project ThreatLevel, TimeGenerated, AlertName, ProductName, AlertSeverity, Description, Entities, StartTime, EndTime\r\n| order by TimeGenerated desc\r\n| take 100",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Security alerts (DNS-related or matching search)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "al-alerts"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _s = '{IPorDomainSearch}';\r\nSecurityIncident\r\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by IncidentNumber\r\n| where isempty(_s) or Title has _s or tostring(AlertIds) has _s\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = case(Severity =~ 'High', '🔴 High', Severity =~ 'Medium', '🟠 Medium', Severity =~ 'Low', '🟡 Low', '🟢 Info')\r\n| extend AlertCount = array_length(todynamic(AlertIds))\r\n| project ThreatLevel, TimeGenerated, IncidentNumber, Title, Severity, Status, AlertCount, FirstActivityTime, LastActivityTime\r\n| order by TimeGenerated desc\r\n| take 100",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Security incidents (open / matching search)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "al-inc"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "group-alerts"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "selectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "investigation"
      },
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## 🔎 Investigation Workspace\n\nType a client IP in **Investigate client IP** above to pivot: device DNS profile, recent queries, and threat-intel hits — no ad-hoc KQL needed. With the box empty, the summary lists top devices as candidates.",
              "style": "info"
            },
            "name": "inv-h"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isempty('{DeviceSearch}') or SrcIpAddr == '{DeviceSearch}'\r\n| summarize FirstSeen = min(TimeGenerated), LastSeen = max(TimeGenerated), TotalQueries = sum(EventCount),\r\n            Domains = dcount(DnsQuery), NXDOMAIN = sumif(EventCount, DnsResponseCode == 3),\r\n            TXT = sumif(EventCount, DnsQueryTypeName == 'TXT'), Country = any(SrcGeoCountry) by SrcIpAddr\r\n| order by TotalQueries desc\r\n| take 25",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Device DNS profile (first/last seen, volume, NXDOMAIN, TXT)",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "NXDOMAIN",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "TXT",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "orange"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "inv-sum"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet TIdom = ThreatIntelIndicators | where IsActive == true and Revoked == false | where ObservableKey in~ ('domain-name:value','hostname:value') | summarize by v = tolower(ObservableValue);\r\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isnotempty('{DeviceSearch}') and SrcIpAddr == '{DeviceSearch}'\r\n| where tolower(DnsQuery) in (TIdom)\r\n| summarize Requests = sum(EventCount), LastSeen = max(TimeGenerated) by DnsQuery\r\n| extend ThreatLevel = '🔴 Critical'\r\n| project ThreatLevel, DnsQuery, Requests, LastSeen\r\n| order by Requests desc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Threat-intel hits for this device",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ThreatLevel",
                    "formatter": 0
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "inv-ti"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n| where isnotempty('{DeviceSearch}') and SrcIpAddr == '{DeviceSearch}'\r\n| summarize Requests = sum(EventCount), FirstSeen = min(TimeGenerated), LastSeen = max(TimeGenerated),\r\n            QueryTypes = make_set(DnsQueryTypeName, 5) by DnsQuery\r\n| order by LastSeen desc\r\n| take 200",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Recent DNS queries for this device",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "inv-recent"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "group-investigation"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "selectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "attack"
      },
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## 🗺️ MITRE ATT&CK Coverage & Detection Pipeline\n\nHow this workbook's DNS analytics map to ATT&CK techniques, plus which detections are currently firing.",
              "style": "info"
            },
            "name": "att-h"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "datatable(Tactic:string, Technique:string, TechniqueID:string, DnsDetection:string)\r\n[\r\n 'Command and Control', 'Application Layer Protocol: DNS', 'T1071.004', 'Long FQDNs, TXT/NULL abuse, excessive subdomains, beaconing',\r\n 'Command and Control', 'Dynamic Resolution: DGA', 'T1568.002', 'Digit-ratio DGA, Shannon entropy, NXDOMAIN spikes',\r\n 'Command and Control', 'Fallback Channels', 'T1008', 'Beaconing regularity, rare domains',\r\n 'Command and Control', 'Encrypted/Proxy: Fast Flux', 'T1568.001', 'One domain to many IPs (fast flux)',\r\n 'Resource Development', 'Acquire Infrastructure: Domains / DDNS', 'T1583.001/.002', 'Dynamic DNS providers, suspicious TLDs, newly observed domains',\r\n 'Discovery', 'Network Service Discovery / Recon', 'T1046', 'PTR reverse-lookup floods',\r\n 'Exfiltration', 'Exfiltration Over C2 Channel', 'T1041', 'TXT/NULL exfil, high-volume egress, tunneling',\r\n 'Impact/Resource', 'Threat-intel IOC match', 'IOC', 'TI domain & IP hits, infected devices'\r\n]\r\n| project Tactic, Technique, TechniqueID, DnsDetection",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "ATT&CK technique coverage (DNS)",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "att-map"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Detections currently firing (affected clients / domains)"
            },
            "name": "att-h2"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "let _ExcIPs_raw = '{ExcludedIPs}';\r\nlet _ExcIPs = iif(_ExcIPs_raw == '', dynamic([]),\r\n    todynamic(strcat('[\"', replace_string(replace_string(_ExcIPs_raw, ' ', ''), ',', '\",\"'), '\"]')));\r\nlet ASimDnsActivityLogs = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    {WatchlistFilter}\r\n    | where _ExcIPs_raw == '' or isempty(SrcIpAddr) or not(ipv4_is_in_any_range(SrcIpAddr, _ExcIPs));\nlet SuspiciousTlds = dynamic(['zip','mov','xyz','top','gq','tk','ml','cf','ga','work','click','country','kim','science','party','review','loan','download','stream','racing','fit','cam','rest','mom']);\r\nlet TIdom = ThreatIntelIndicators | where IsActive == true and Revoked == false | where ObservableKey in~ ('domain-name:value','hostname:value') | summarize by v = tolower(ObservableValue);\r\nlet DnsMal = ASimDnsActivityLogs\r\n    | extend _len = strlen(DnsQuery)\r\n    | extend _labels = split(DnsQuery, '.')\r\n    | extend _tld = tolower(tostring(_labels[array_length(_labels) - 1]))\r\n    | extend IsMalicious = (DnsResponseCode == 3) or (_len >= 50) or (DnsQueryTypeName in ('TXT','NULL')) or (_tld in (SuspiciousTlds));\r\nunion\r\n(DnsMal | where _len >= 50 | summarize Count = dcount(SrcIpAddr) | extend Finding = 'DNS tunneling (long queries)', Severity = '🟠 High', Order = 1),\r\n(DnsMal | where DnsQueryTypeName in ('TXT','NULL') | summarize Count = dcount(SrcIpAddr) | extend Finding = 'Suspicious TXT / NULL records', Severity = '🟠 High', Order = 2),\r\n(DnsMal | where DnsResponseCode == 3 | summarize Count = dcount(SrcIpAddr) | extend Finding = 'Excessive NXDOMAIN clients', Severity = '🟠 High', Order = 3),\r\n(DnsMal | where _tld in (SuspiciousTlds) | summarize Count = dcount(DnsQuery) | extend Finding = 'Suspicious TLD domains', Severity = '🟡 Medium', Order = 4),\r\n(DnsMal | where IsMalicious | summarize Count = dcount(SrcIpAddr) | extend Finding = 'Clients with malicious DNS', Severity = '🔴 Critical', Order = 5),\r\n(ASimDnsActivityLogs | where tolower(DnsQuery) in (TIdom) | summarize Count = dcount(SrcIpAddr) | extend Finding = 'Threat-intel domain hits', Severity = '🔴 Critical', Order = 6)\r\n| project Order, Severity, Finding, Count\r\n| sort by Order asc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Active DNS detections",
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Severity",
                    "formatter": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Count",
                    "formatter": 4,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange"
            },
            "name": "att-cov"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "group-attack"
    }
  ],
  "styleSettings": {},
  "$schema": "https://github.com/Microsoft/Application-Insights-Workbooks/blob/master/schema/workbook.json"
}